  lines:
  - speaker: Friend
    text: Hey, anything change between you and Chelsea?
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 3
  - speaker: Luke
    text: "Oof yeah, sorry I haven\u2019t kept you updated\u2026 we\u2019re on a
      break, I guess."
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 9
  - speaker: Friend
    text: Oh... What happened?
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 12
  - speaker: Luke
    text: She said she's mad at me because it feels like she's been the only one
      putting in the effort to make plans for us lately.
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 18
  - speaker: Luke
    text: She says I haven't been reaching out much anymore. And honestly, she's
      not wrong...
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 23
  - speaker: Luke
    text: I guess I just got used to her making plans for us, y'know?
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 27
  - speaker: Friend
    text: Ahh, I see. So, you guys gonna talk soon? Patch up?
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 32
  - speaker: Luke
    text: Well, the issue is, I'm not sure how to approach her. Or if approaching
      her right now is even a good move.
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 39
  - speaker: Luke
    text: "Like, I have an idea, I just\u2026 I don't know if it\u2019s good enough,
      you know?"
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 43
  - speaker: Friend
    text: "Look man, whatever it is, it\u2019s probably worth a shot. I mean, we\u2019re
      still trying to have that party before we all leave, right?"
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 49
  - speaker: Friend
    text: Might wanna try and talk to her before that.
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 52
  - speaker: Luke
    text: "I know, it\u2019s just everything I think of sounds stupid to me."
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 56
  - speaker: Luke
    text: "I\u2019ll think of something good eventually though\u2026 I hope\u2026"
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 59
